{"id":"urn:estate:voting-app:rule:vote-must-fit-the-record","action":"urn:estate:voting-app:action:cast-vote","condition":"(input.choice == null || size(input.choice) <= 255) && (input.voter_id == null || size(input.voter_id) <= 255)","evidence":["urn:estate:voting-app:source:repository worker/Program.cs#L96-L99","urn:estate:voting-app:source:repository vote/app.py#L34-L37"],"kind":"check","statement":"A vote whose choice or voter identifier is longer than 255 characters is refused and records nothing."}
{"id":"urn:estate:voting-app:rule:votes-outlive-a-restart","applies_to":["urn:estate:voting-app:capability:vote-casting"],"characteristic":"reliability","evidence":["urn:estate:voting-app:source:repository docker-stack.yml#L19-L20","urn:estate:voting-app:source:repository docker-stack.yml#L52-L53","urn:estate:voting-app:source:repository docker-stack.yml#L9-L12","urn:estate:voting-app:source:repository k8s-specifications/db-deployment.yaml#L28-L33","urn:estate:voting-app:source:repository k8s-specifications/redis-deployment.yaml#L23-L28"],"kind":"quality","statement":"A vote shown to the voter as taken outlives a restart or replacement of any part of the estate, in every deployment, and is counted once the parts are back. The estate sets no measure."}
{"id":"urn:estate:voting-app:rule:watchers-told-when-standing-cannot-be-counted","applies_to":["urn:estate:voting-app:action:publish-standing"],"characteristic":"reliability","evidence":["urn:estate:voting-app:source:repository result/server.js#L24-L53"],"kind":"quality","statement":"While the votes cannot be counted, every watcher is told the standing is unavailable, and the standing is published again on its own once they can be. The estate sets no measure."}
